:: Lake Mason Swim Together
<<effects>>
<<npc Mason>><<person1>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to 'lake'>>
<<pass 30>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You ask Mason if you can join <<him>> for a few laps.
    <br><br>
    Mason pauses, then nods. "A-all right. Try to keep to my pace, but stop if you need a rest."
    <br><br>
    You swim beside Mason. <<His>> strokes are steady, leaving a trail of bubbles through the water.
    <br><br>
    After a few laps, Mason slows down and treads water. "How are you doing?" Mason asks. "We can stop here for a bit."
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你问梅森，能不能和<<him>>一起游几趟。
    <br><br>
    梅森顿了顿，点点头。“好、好吧。试着跟上我的速度，累了就停下来。”
    <br><br>
    你游在梅森身旁。<<His>>划水的动作很稳，身后留下一串气泡。
    <br><br>
    游过几趟后，梅森放慢速度，停下来踩水。“还好吗？”梅森问，“可以在这里歇一会儿。”
<</language>><br><br>
<<swimmingskilluse 10>><<physique 3>><<npcincr Mason love 2>><<npcincr Mason lust 1>><<glust 'Mason'>><<stress -8>><<lstress>><br><br>
<<lanLink `["Next", "继续"]` "Lake Depths">><<endevent>><</lanLink>>

